Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:26.14,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs95\fad(300,0)\1c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4\fn@汉仪正圆-65S\frz281.1\pos(438.703,314.031)}我拿不动嘛
